<title>UK: UK July official reserves rise underlying $18 mln.</title>
<headline>UK July official reserves rise underlying $18 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's gold and currency reserves rose an underlying $18 million in July, the Treasury said on Monday.</p>
<p>(in million dollars).</p>
<p>				  JULY	   JUNE</p>
<p>Underlying reserves	 +18	     -2</p>
<p>Actual reserves	    +581	    -13</p>
<p>Total actual reserves   41.14 bln    40.56 bln</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7708</p>
</text>
